@startuml
title RF56 — Practice squad · Diagrama de sequência
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber
actor "Head coach / manager (usuário autenticado)" as Manager
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
boundary "API" as API
control "UseCase" as UseCase
control "MarketEngine" as MarketEngine
control "CapEngine" as CapEngine
database "MySQL 8" as MySQL
database "Cassandra 4.1" as Cassandra
participant "Agendador/Job assíncrono" as Scheduler
actor "Franquia adversária (IA)" as ClubeIA
Manager -> Frontend: abre practice squad
Frontend -> API: GET /careers/{id}/practice-squad
API -> UseCase: GetPracticeSquadUseCase
UseCase -> MySQL: membros, regras da liga
UseCase --> API: PracticeSquadView
API --> Frontend: 200
Manager -> Frontend: elevar jogador
Frontend -> API: POST /practice-squad/{psId}/elevate
API -> UseCase: ElevatePracticeSquadPlayerUseCase
alt limite de elevações
  API --> Frontend: 422 ELEVATION_LIMIT
else senão
  UseCase -> MySQL: elevationsUsed+1, ativo no jogo
  API --> Frontend: 200
end
Manager -> Frontend: promover ao 53
Frontend -> API: POST /practice-squad/{psId}/promote
API -> UseCase: PromoteToActiveRosterUseCase
UseCase -> CapEngine: cabe no teto?
alt elenco cheio ou sem cap
  API --> Frontend: 422 ROSTER_FULL / CAP_EXCEEDED
else senão
  UseCase -> MySQL: TX: contrato ativo, cap ledger, remove membro
  API --> Frontend: 200
end
Scheduler -> UseCase: PostGameReturnElevated
UseCase -> MySQL: elevados de volta ao practice squad
Scheduler -> MarketEngine: IA procura reforços no practice squad alheio
MarketEngine -> ClubeIA: contrata não protegido?
ClubeIA --> MarketEngine: sim / não
MarketEngine -> Cassandra: inbox: jogador levado
@enduml
